\newlabel{fig:training-dynamics}{{2}{5}{FiLM v2 training dynamics. Phase~1 (steps 1--200) exhibits violent exploration with large state norms and rapid changes. Phase~2 (steps 200--1000) shows convergent self-regularization. The dashed red line marks the phase transition}{figure.2}{}}
