\@writefile{lot}{\contentsline {table}{\numberline {7}{\ignorespaces Complete insensitivity to $\alpha $. The $\tanh $ bound is not the limiting factor; the modulation structure is intrinsically saturated. $w_{\mathrm  {std}}/w_{\mathrm  {mean}} = 0.0015$ is pure initialization noise level.}}{6}{table.7}\protected@file@percent }
