\newlabel{fig:phase-diagram}{{4}{8}{Phase transition diagram in $|S|$--$dS$ space. The training trajectory (black arrows) shows the system transitioning from Phase~1 (violent exploration, high norm and change rate) through Phase~2 (convergent modulation) toward Phase~3 (structural specialization, not fully achieved). Shaded regions indicate the characteristic parameter ranges for each phase}{figure.4}{}}
